  "title": "Side Chapter · Decorations",
  "subtitle": "Magical Chisel and patterns",
  "icon": "essentialcraft5:magical_chisel",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "magical_chisel",
      "title": "{item:essentialcraft5:magical_chisel}",
      "icon": "essentialcraft5:magical_chisel",
      "summary": "Chisel building blocks into patterns",
      "complete": "essentialcraft5:guide/decorations/magical_chisel",
      "optional": true,
      "items": [
        "essentialcraft5:magical_chisel"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "text": "With the work done, I took the leftover stone and carved patterns into it. A wall ought to look like something. Spend long enough inside one and you'll want it to.",
          "by": "Workshop Notebook"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "<em>Goal</em> (optional): make a {item:essentialcraft5:magical_chisel} and carve a few building blocks into patterned decorative blocks. This chapter is only about looks and touches nothing else, so come whenever you like. You can make the chisel as soon as you have the Elemental Gems from Chapter 1."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "<em>Prepare</em>: 4 {item:essentialcraft5:elemental_gem} ([[elements/elemental_gem]]) and 1 {item:minecraft:stick}, placed anywhere in a crafting grid."
        },
        {
          "type": "recipe",
          "item": "essentialcraft5:magical_chisel"
        },
        {
          "type": "h",
          "text": "How to use it"
        },
        {
          "type": "steps",
          "items": [
            "Put the chisel and one base block in a crafting grid, in any slots.",
            "Take out 4 <em>Big Tiles</em>. The chisel stays where it was and loses 1 durability.",
            "Keep adding base blocks. A chisel lasts exactly <t>256</t> crafts, 1,024 Big Tiles in all.",
            "Big Tiles can be crafted into the other patterns ([[decorations/patterns]])."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "tip",
          "style": "good",
          "title": "Done when",
          "text": "The grid shows 4 Big Tiles and the chisel is still in its slot."
        },
        {
          "type": "h",
          "text": "Base blocks you can chisel"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "header": [
            "Base",
            "Where from",
            "Patterned version"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "{item:essentialcraft5:magical_slag}",
              "a [[generators/heat_generator]] makes one per fuel item, and a [[magmatic/smeltery]] one per batch it processes",
              "the background shimmers; the blocks it makes are named \"MRU …\""
            ],
            {
              "if": "cfg:general.hoanna.portal_enabled",
              "cells": [
                "{item:essentialcraft5:concrete}",
                "towns and catacombs in Hoanna (see [[hoanna/ruins]])",
                "needs a pickaxe"
              ]
            },
            [
              "{item:essentialcraft5:fortified_stone}",
              "[[crafting/fortified]]",
              "needs a pickaxe"
            ],
            [
              "{item:essentialcraft5:cold_stone}",
              "[[generators/cold_distillator]]",
              "breaks by hand, counts as a cold source around a Cold Distillator just like Cold Stone (<t>0.5</t> each), and mobs don't spawn on it"
            ],
            [
              "{item:essentialcraft5:magic_plating}",
              "[[alloys/plating]]",
              "needs a pickaxe"
            ],
            [
              "{item:essentialcraft5:pale_plating}",
              "[[alloys/plating]]",
              "needs a pickaxe"
            ],
            {
              "if": "cfg:general.hoanna.portal_enabled",
              "cells": [
                "{item:essentialcraft5:void_stone}",
                "[[hoanna/void_stone]]",
                "needs a pickaxe"
              ]
            },
            [
              "{item:essentialcraft5:mithriline_plating}",
              "[[mithriline/furnace]]",
              "needs a pickaxe"
            ],
            {
              "if": "cfg:general.hoanna.portal_enabled",
              "cells": [
                "{item:essentialcraft5:demonic_plating}",
                "[[demons/demonic_plating]]",
                "needs a pickaxe"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "widths": [
            3,
            4,
            4
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Mimic Blocks can be chiseled too, into solid Fancy Mimic Blocks ([[decorations/fancy_mimic]])."
        },
        {
          "type": "tip",
          "style": "info",
          "title": "Planning materials",
          "text": "One base block gives 4 Big Tiles, and most later patterns trade evenly (4 for 4, 8 for 8, 9 for 9), so a stack of 64 base blocks comes to about 256 patterned blocks. For a large floor, chisel all your base blocks in one go."
        },
        {
          "type": "tip",
          "style": "warn",
          "title": "Watch out",
          "text": "The recipe book only auto-places an undamaged chisel and ignores a <w>used</w> one, so put a used chisel in the grid yourself.\nThe chisel can't be repaired or combined with another. When it wears out, make a new one."
        },
        {
          "type": "h",
          "text": "Fine print"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "header": [
            "Patterned block",
            "Hardness",
            "Blast resistance"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "MRU (Magical Slag)",
              "1",
              "60"
            ],
            {
              "if": "cfg:general.hoanna.portal_enabled",
              "cells": [
                "Concrete",
                "1",
                "3"
              ]
            },
            [
              "Fortified Stone",
              "1.5",
              "4.8"
            ],
            [
              "Cold Stone",
              "0.7",
              "0.7"
            ],
            [
              "Magical Plating",
              "2",
              "4.8"
            ],
            [
              "Pale Plating",
              "2",
              "4.8"
            ],
            {
              "if": "cfg:general.hoanna.portal_enabled",
              "cells": [
                "Void Stone",
                "3",
                "16.8"
              ]
            },
            [
              "Mithriline Plating",
              "3",
              "60"
            ],
            {
              "if": "cfg:general.hoanna.portal_enabled",
              "cells": [
                "Demonic Plating",
                "3",
                "60"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "widths": [
            4,
            2,
            2
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Most patterned blocks break a little faster than their base, and some stand up to explosions less well. For blast-proof walls, pick the MRU or mithriline plating patterns, which have blast resistance 60."
        },
        {
          "type": "tip",
          "style": "lore",
          "text": "The original research book gave its decorations section the subtitle \"Fancy it all up!\""
        }
      ]
    },
